    "show_share": true,
    "description": "AKU has developed Pakistan's first Advanced Practice Nursing (APN) training programme, which is endorsed by the Pakistan Nursing Council as a pilot programme for potential scale-up, and is currently being discussed with the regulatory bodies for its formal launch in the country.",
